WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:03.400
You've always been like this.

00:03.400 --> 00:06.500
You always think you're the one who's right.

00:06.500 --> 00:10.340
You were only friends with me because
you felt sorry for me.

00:11.140 --> 00:12.370
No!

00:12.370 --> 00:13.880
You just used feeling sorry for me

00:13.880 --> 00:17.110
as a means to wallow in your own
sense of superiority, am I right?

00:17.110 --> 00:18.740
No!

00:19.610 --> 00:23.020
There's something I figured out
after I came to this world.

00:24.050 --> 00:28.920
In my heart, I always hated you.

00:31.360 --> 00:34.620
That's right, I hated you.

00:48.910 --> 00:50.540
Roya...

01:15.600 --> 01:23.210
Far away from the town where I was born

01:23.210 --> 01:26.380
I am singing

01:26.380 --> 01:34.020
Tucking my weak heart and my wavering feelings

01:34.020 --> 01:37.290
Away in my pocket

01:37.290 --> 01:42.830
Toward where I hear someone calling me

01:42.830 --> 01:47.870
Toward the unknown road

01:47.870 --> 01:53.310
I'll walk

01:53.310 --> 01:58.710
I'll move forward

01:58.710 --> 02:03.550
Not for someone else's sake

02:03.550 --> 02:09.020
But just as I am, so that I can take pride

02:09.020 --> 02:14.500
Just as the sun rises at dawn

02:14.500 --> 02:19.730
I pick out a melody with my voice

02:19.730 --> 02:23.760
Ephemerally yet strongly

02:25.410 --> 02:28.930
I live

02:35.520 --> 02:39.210
Episode 31
The Cost of Ambition

02:54.570 --> 02:57.210
You did splendidly, Noah.

02:57.210 --> 03:00.730
Holy Father Hyrum is also quite pleased.

03:01.740 --> 03:03.540
I see.

03:04.980 --> 03:06.780
Thank you very much.

03:17.930 --> 03:22.800
Losing to a rival means you won't
be able to be a hero quite yet.

03:23.200 --> 03:25.100
Oh, Master Robès!

03:25.770 --> 03:27.370
Master Robès!

03:27.370 --> 03:29.500
Oh, he's so handsome!

03:29.500 --> 03:31.270
Master Robès!

03:31.270 --> 03:32.510
Listen, you three,

03:32.510 --> 03:32.870
Master Robès! Master Robès!
Listen, you three,

03:32.870 --> 03:35.440
Master Robès! Master Robès!
this place is off limits to everyone
but authorized individuals!

03:35.440 --> 03:36.580
Oh, dear, it looks as though I
have even more fans now.

03:36.580 --> 03:38.380
Stay back! Hey!
Oh, dear, it looks as though I
have even more fans now.

03:38.380 --> 03:40.550
Master Robès! Master Robès!
Oh, dear, it looks as though I
have even more fans now.

03:40.550 --> 03:41.750
Yes, yes, here I come.

03:41.750 --> 03:45.020
It's awfully stuffy in here, so let's go
enjoy ourselves elsewhere.

03:45.020 --> 03:46.820
Here now, come with me.

03:49.220 --> 03:52.020
We will now begin Round Two Match Two.

03:52.730 --> 03:57.890
Helic of Ulvarx vs. Rahja of Tusk!

04:02.170 --> 04:04.470
Be careful, Helic.

04:05.170 --> 04:08.340
I have a bad feeling about that one.

04:10.480 --> 04:13.570
You're certainly eerie enough,
hiding your face like that.

04:14.180 --> 04:18.350
But it won't matter how strong
your spirits may be;

04:18.350 --> 04:20.820
they're useless against me!

04:28.700 --> 04:30.490
Here I come!

04:39.240 --> 04:41.730
Thinks he's hidden himself in
the smoke, does he?

04:50.450 --> 04:52.950
Damn! He's a quick one!

04:52.950 --> 04:54.580
Armath!

05:11.640 --> 05:15.130
Wait here in this room until the formalities
have been carried out.

05:16.040 --> 05:18.180
What do you mean, "formalities"?

05:18.180 --> 05:19.450
Hey, wait!

05:19.450 --> 05:21.680
I said wait! Hey!

05:35.330 --> 05:37.130
This place...

05:39.870 --> 05:42.370
You're not one to be done in so easily.

05:42.370 --> 05:45.200
Come on, let out your spirit now!

05:47.310 --> 05:49.040
Armath!

05:56.620 --> 05:58.780
There, what will you do now?

06:00.860 --> 06:03.290
I get it. Two of them, eh?

06:03.290 --> 06:04.990
Armath!

06:08.400 --> 06:10.190
It's no use.

06:13.840 --> 06:16.300
What? There's a third?!

06:32.090 --> 06:33.710
Helic!

06:39.790 --> 06:42.760
The winner: Rahja of Tusk!

06:45.030 --> 06:47.200
He is powerful, like I thought.

06:47.200 --> 06:49.730
Just who is that guy?

06:51.410 --> 06:54.340
Moving right along, we will
now begin Match Three:

06:54.340 --> 06:59.140
Geh-Geh of Tusk vs. Elmeida of Zymot!

07:06.790 --> 07:09.890
Zed! Wake up, Zed!

07:09.890 --> 07:11.660
Roya's in trouble!

07:11.660 --> 07:13.790
Zed! Zed!

07:15.530 --> 07:17.160
Zakua!

07:23.940 --> 07:28.900
Spirit or shard caster,
it makes no difference to me!

07:59.970 --> 08:02.240
My arms will break...

08:04.410 --> 08:07.380
I... I give up!

08:13.420 --> 08:16.910
The winner: Elmeida of Zymot!

08:16.990 --> 08:19.760
Hey, what happened?

08:19.760 --> 08:22.020
Is she all right?

08:23.130 --> 08:24.930
What happened down there?

08:25.400 --> 08:27.000
Hey, what happened?

08:27.000 --> 08:28.040
She's not getting up!

08:28.040 --> 08:29.830
Is something wrong?

08:37.380 --> 08:40.140
So, she has died then?

08:42.250 --> 08:46.150
Holy Father Hyrum, how shall we proceed?

08:47.360 --> 08:52.160
Stop the Joust, I will go down there.

09:00.330 --> 09:03.330
Hey! Wake up, Zed!

09:10.110 --> 09:13.480
Roya's in big trouble! Save her!

09:17.520 --> 09:19.150
Roya?

09:19.890 --> 09:21.520
Hurry, Zed!

09:21.520 --> 09:23.060
Right...

09:23.060 --> 09:24.890
You stay here!

09:31.370 --> 09:37.530
It is with great regret that I must announce that
this Joust has yielded our very first fatality.

09:38.570 --> 09:45.910
Custom dictates that I, as chairman of this Joust,
offer my prayers over the bravely fallen.

09:57.390 --> 09:59.020
What?!

10:05.000 --> 10:07.970
Your head is mine!

10:15.410 --> 10:18.810
You sought to assassinate His Holiness
from the start, didn't you?

10:19.910 --> 10:21.680
You again?

10:21.680 --> 10:26.320
You've done nothing but get in my way, boy.

10:26.320 --> 10:28.090
This is a capital offense!

10:28.090 --> 10:29.890
I will execute you here!

10:35.800 --> 10:37.570
So, I've failed, have I?

10:37.570 --> 10:39.400
I guess this is goodbye.

10:44.670 --> 10:46.940
After her! Don't let her escape!

10:46.940 --> 10:48.410
Holy Father Hyrum...

10:48.410 --> 10:49.640
Your Holiness!

10:49.640 --> 10:51.880
Holy Father, are you all right?

10:51.880 --> 10:53.680
Summon the medical squad!

11:06.930 --> 11:09.260
Damn, where did she go?

11:09.960 --> 11:11.900
Okay, you men go that way!

11:11.900 --> 11:13.530
Yes, sir!

11:21.840 --> 11:23.440
Attention, everyone.

11:23.440 --> 11:25.350
Your silence, please.

11:25.350 --> 11:28.080
As you can see, I am unharmed.

11:28.080 --> 11:34.150
And I decree that under Absolute Law,
this holy Joust shall continue!

11:37.860 --> 11:39.690
Okay, then...

11:39.690 --> 11:42.720
Here! You lose again, Master Robès.

11:44.270 --> 11:46.330
I lose again, do I?

11:46.330 --> 11:48.460
Here, drink up!

11:53.570 --> 11:56.610
My word, the wine here is exquisite.

11:56.610 --> 12:00.450
Are you losing on purpose because
you want to drink the wine?

12:00.450 --> 12:01.980
That's what I think!

12:01.980 --> 12:04.590
Why, nothing of the sort!

12:04.590 --> 12:09.620
Besides, if I drink any more than this,
it might hinder me in the next match.

12:09.620 --> 12:13.860
I wouldn't be able to dedicate
my victory to you ladies.

12:14.360 --> 12:17.830
Oh, dear, whatever do you mean, Master Robès?

12:17.830 --> 12:20.730
We're already well past the time for your match.

12:26.340 --> 12:28.680
As Robès Redondo of Templar

12:28.680 --> 12:33.880
failed to appear in time for the match,
the victory goes to Rahja.

12:33.880 --> 12:35.080
Therefore, we will now begin the final round,

12:35.080 --> 12:38.420
against Noah of Neotopia.

12:38.950 --> 12:42.860
Final Round: Noah of Neotopia

12:42.860 --> 12:45.330
vs. Rahja of Tusk.

12:45.330 --> 12:47.190
We're counting on you, Noah!

12:47.190 --> 12:48.400
Go for it, Noah!

12:48.400 --> 12:50.020
Begin!

12:55.340 --> 12:56.700
What's the matter?

12:56.700 --> 12:59.010
If you want to see me make the first move,

12:59.010 --> 13:00.800
then as you wish!

13:01.380 --> 13:08.110
Zed, I will win and prove to you the
righteousness of Absolute Law!

13:28.940 --> 13:30.640
You're...

13:30.640 --> 13:32.610
That's Hugh, isn't it?

13:34.810 --> 13:37.280
What are you doing in this tournament?

13:37.280 --> 13:40.510
The key spirit is all I am after.

13:40.510 --> 13:43.750
When I learned that two of them would be
present in this tournament,

13:43.750 --> 13:46.720
naturally I had to enter myself.

13:51.930 --> 13:53.790
Um, this is...

13:53.790 --> 13:54.830
A grave.

13:54.830 --> 13:56.030
A grave?!

13:56.030 --> 13:57.500
That's right.

13:57.500 --> 14:01.300
The emaciated corpses of those who
have been sentenced here

14:01.300 --> 14:03.670
are interred in those receptacles.

14:03.670 --> 14:06.300
You will soon be in one yourself.

14:07.780 --> 14:09.040
You've got to be kidding me!

14:09.040 --> 14:11.580
There are no exceptions to Absolute Law.

14:11.580 --> 14:15.280
Those who violate the law pay with their lives.

14:20.820 --> 14:22.490
What do you think you're going to do to Roya?

14:22.490 --> 14:24.460
Shut your mouth and move aside!

14:24.460 --> 14:26.990
You shall not pass!

14:26.990 --> 14:28.620
Curias!

14:32.970 --> 14:34.590
Damn...

14:35.500 --> 14:37.300
Amir Gaul is gone!

14:42.680 --> 14:45.310
I will have your key spirit.

14:45.310 --> 14:46.940
Pronimo!

14:51.390 --> 14:53.010
Sachura!

15:05.900 --> 15:07.870
Most impressive, Sachura.

15:07.870 --> 15:09.670
In that case...

15:11.570 --> 15:12.970
Amir Gaul!

15:12.970 --> 15:14.600
What?!

15:18.450 --> 15:21.850
How did he get Amir Gaul?

15:21.850 --> 15:23.480
Bastard!

15:25.650 --> 15:27.490
Amir Gaul...

15:27.490 --> 15:30.490
When? And who stole him?!

15:30.490 --> 15:32.290
Get him!

15:36.830 --> 15:38.460
Rambos!

15:41.140 --> 15:44.830
Don't I have enough power left
to even summon Rambos?

15:51.110 --> 15:52.180
You?!

15:52.180 --> 15:56.620
Don't get the wrong idea,
I'm not here to help you.

15:56.620 --> 16:00.020
See, I heard my beloved cutie was in trouble.

16:00.020 --> 16:01.650
Goliath!

16:08.130 --> 16:10.800
I'll let you be the prince on the white horse.

16:10.800 --> 16:12.100
Now, get going!

16:12.100 --> 16:13.900
Thanks, man!

16:16.140 --> 16:19.670
Why does Hugh have Amir Gaul?

16:19.670 --> 16:23.200
In any case, let's leave this to Noah.

16:23.910 --> 16:25.540
Sachura!

16:45.370 --> 16:47.600
Magnificent...

16:47.600 --> 16:50.600
Now this is the power of the key spirits!

16:50.600 --> 16:54.440
This is power that the king who will
rule the world should hold.

17:03.050 --> 17:05.020
It seems this is the end for you.

17:06.150 --> 17:10.490
Well then, I believe I shall be taking
the key spirit Sachura.

17:28.910 --> 17:32.070
Prostrate yourself before your king.

17:42.020 --> 17:44.060
What are you doing?!

17:44.060 --> 17:46.030
Let me out of here!

17:49.360 --> 17:51.160
This place...

17:51.570 --> 17:53.360
What's that?!

18:05.250 --> 18:08.120
Your Holiness, I believe Noah is unable
to carry on with the fight.

18:08.120 --> 18:10.080
We do not know that yet.

18:33.770 --> 18:36.280
What is happening to Hugh?

18:36.280 --> 18:40.880
The key spirits, with their special powers,
choose their masters.

18:40.880 --> 18:42.050
That is to say,

18:42.050 --> 18:45.180
if one who has not been chosen takes
a key spirit within himself,

18:46.620 --> 18:49.110
the spirit may react by rejecting that person.

18:52.290 --> 18:56.160
The rejection Amir Gaul causes
is especially potent.

18:56.160 --> 18:59.330
It has even been said to eat away at
one's body from the inside.

19:12.280 --> 19:13.280
Roya!

19:13.280 --> 19:14.910
Zed?!

19:17.520 --> 19:19.150
Roya!

19:30.300 --> 19:31.330
Zed!

19:31.330 --> 19:33.890
Roya! Are you okay?

19:34.500 --> 19:36.800
Yeah, I am.

19:37.640 --> 19:39.470
Thank goodness.

19:39.470 --> 19:41.240
Now, let's get out of here quick!

19:41.240 --> 19:42.870
Yeah!

19:48.350 --> 19:51.320
Is that how a spirit rejection works?

19:51.320 --> 19:53.180
I'll keep that in mind.

19:54.050 --> 19:58.230
And I'll be taking Amir Gaul's
spirit shard back now,

19:58.230 --> 20:00.030
since it is Zed's, after all.

20:00.030 --> 20:02.150
Damn...

20:09.100 --> 20:10.730
Damn!

20:17.440 --> 20:22.400
We will now be holding our awards ceremony
to honor the winner of the Joust.

20:24.050 --> 20:27.650
The winner is Noah of Neotopia!

20:27.650 --> 20:29.620
Noah!

20:41.870 --> 20:44.440
This is probably far enough.
We should be okay.

20:44.440 --> 20:47.070
All you need to do now is shift out of here.

20:47.070 --> 20:49.410
I really owe you.

20:49.410 --> 20:52.310
I said I wasn't doing it for you.

20:52.310 --> 20:54.350
Right, honey?

20:54.350 --> 20:56.980
H..Honey?

20:59.190 --> 21:00.750
Who's there?

21:00.750 --> 21:02.380
Noah!

21:04.590 --> 21:06.060
What, Noah?

21:06.060 --> 21:07.630
Is there something you want?

21:07.630 --> 21:10.960
Or was our fight earlier not enough for you?

21:17.040 --> 21:19.700
I wanted to return this to you.

21:21.740 --> 21:24.080
That's Amir Gaul!

21:24.080 --> 21:25.910
How did you get that?

21:25.910 --> 21:27.510
Who stole it from me?!

21:27.510 --> 21:30.050
That is of no concern to me.

21:30.050 --> 21:34.520
What I want to know is why you
wouldn't fight me seriously!

21:34.520 --> 21:38.560
There's no point to a fight like that
if you don't do it in earnest!

21:38.560 --> 21:41.890
You don't understand how I feel at all!

21:48.940 --> 21:50.960
I've got to go.

21:52.510 --> 21:54.470
A pursuit squad will be here shortly.

21:55.280 --> 21:59.010
You are all criminals who have
disobeyed the law.

22:02.720 --> 22:04.380
Let's go.

22:04.380 --> 22:06.180
Let's hurry, Zed.

22:44.790 --> 22:49.560
Even if we've been far apart

22:49.560 --> 22:53.600
Our hearts are still connected

22:53.600 --> 22:57.170
And always will be, even to the end of time

22:57.170 --> 23:03.510
I want to stay shining forever and ever (stay gold)

23:03.510 --> 23:08.380
I want to stay glittering (stay gold)

23:08.380 --> 23:09.680
My old days

23:09.680 --> 23:12.050
Living it up on the weekend as always

23:12.050 --> 23:15.890
Just simply having fun, innocently

23:15.890 --> 23:19.760
Grateful days, gone in the blink of an eye

23:19.760 --> 23:22.130
Since then, we've gone our separate ways

23:22.130 --> 23:24.030
Chasing our own goals

23:24.030 --> 23:25.030
We grow up

23:25.030 --> 23:26.700
Tuck our memories in our hearts, and wave

23:26.700 --> 23:27.870
Fix our eyes on where we're going

23:27.870 --> 23:29.870
Neither of us will give up

23:29.870 --> 23:31.510
Knowing the other's fighting just as hard

23:31.510 --> 23:33.610
I don't mind if you're not near me

23:33.610 --> 23:35.580
I want to see your smile, but it's not the time

23:35.580 --> 23:36.580
The more I look back

23:36.580 --> 23:37.580
The more I tell myself I'll show this to you one day

23:37.580 --> 23:39.840
That will never change

23:40.410 --> 23:45.220
Even if we've been far apart

23:45.220 --> 23:49.290
Our hearts are still connected

23:49.290 --> 23:52.890
And always will be, even to the end of time

23:52.890 --> 23:59.230
I want to stay shining forever and ever (stay gold)

23:59.230 --> 24:04.930
I want to stay glittering (stay gold)

24:17.280 --> 24:20.940
Next Time
The Nation's Agenda

24:17.880 --> 24:20.940


Next time, "The Nation's Agenda"
